        <Param val="In each trial, you will first study a list of words.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will then see six test words, one at a time.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For each test word:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press (F) if you SAW the word in the study list.&amp;#10;Press (J)  if you DID NOT SEE the word in the study list.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After each response, rate how confident you are:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1 = Low confidence&amp;#10;2 = Medium confidence&amp;#10;3 = High confidence&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Respond as quickly and accurately as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin." valType="str" updates="set every repeat" name="text"/>
